          "type": "text",
          "newLine": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Date format",
            "de": "Datumsformat"
          },
          "help": {
            "en": "Empty = ioBroker system format. Tokens: D/DD day, M/MM month, MMM/MMMM month name, YY/YYYY year, ddd/dddd weekday (e.g. DD. MMMM YYYY)",
            "de": "Leer = ioBroker-Systemformat. Platzhalter: D/DD Tag, M/MM Monat, MMM/MMMM Monatsname, YY/YYYY Jahr, ddd/dddd Wochentag (z.B. DD. MMMM YYYY)"
